1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:08,160
Before you run a strategy for real, test it on past prices.

2
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:13,080
Select one of your strategies and click Test.

3
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:20,510
It opens in the Tester with its settings. You can change any of them before the test.

4
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:23,640
Choose the instrument to test it on.

5
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:28,000
Set the time period and timeframe to look back over.

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:39,250
Press Start. It replays the past prices and trades them for you.

7
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:44,310
The results: profit or loss, win rate, drawdown and number of trades.

8
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:49,380
The chart marks every buy and sell the strategy made.

9
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:54,940
On the right, the full breakdown. No real money is used.

10
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:58,440
History lists every test trade. You can export it to a CSV file.

